<resources>
    <string name="app_name">Turnia</string>
    <string-array name="loading_phrases">
        <item>Negotiating with fate (and with your night-shift colleague)…</item>
        <item>Aligning the stars… and the team's schedules.</item>
        <item>Cracking the quantum physics of getting a whole weekend off.</item>
        <item>Fitting shifts together better than a game of Tetris.</item>
        <item>Waiting for the miracle of a schedule that works for everyone…</item>
        <item>Working out how many coffees this week is going to take.</item>
        <item>Trading mornings for afternoons and rescuing last-minute plans…</item>
        <item>Rearranging time so you finally get a social life.</item>
        <item>Launching shift-swap diplomacy…</item>
        <item>Checking the rota: one second, we've almost got it.</item>
        <item>Trading the night shift for a slice of cake...</item>
        <item>Looking for the brave soul who'll cover the bank holiday...</item>
        <item>Rearranging the pieces of the weekly puzzle.</item>
        <item>Syncing clocks and avoiding mysterious overlaps.</item>
        <item>Checking whether a Friday off is a myth or a reality.</item>
        <item>Turning schedule chaos into peace of mind.</item>
        <item>Fitting the pieces together before someone asks for a swap.</item>
        <item>Calculating the odds of two days off in a row.</item>
        <item>Adjusting the roster so everyone can breathe.</item>
        <item>Rolling out the red carpet for your next day off.</item>
    </string-array>

